    <string name="didomi_ccpa_notice_consent">&lt;p&gt;We collect some personal data like your IP address or the browser’s cookies and we sell it to third parties. This helps us in delivering personalized ads and to monitor and improve our service, but you can choose to opt-out from the sale using the button below.&lt;br /&gt;Please visit our &lt;a href=\"{privacyPolicyURL}\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for more information about your rights.&lt;/p&gt;</string>
    <string name="didomi_ccpa_notice_consent_complete">&lt;h1&gt;Your privacy&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;We collect some personal data like your IP address or the browser’s cookies and we sell it to third parties. This helps us in delivering personalized ads and to monitor and improve our service, but you can choose to opt-out from the sale using the button below.&lt;br /&gt;Please visit our &lt;a href=\"{privacyPolicyURL}\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for more information about your rights.&lt;/p&gt;</string>
