    <string name="didomi_ccpa_preferences_consent">&lt;p&gt;We and our partners place cookies, access and use non-sensitive information from your device for the following purposes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Auditing Interactions with Consumers&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Security&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Debugging/Repair&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Certain Short-term Uses&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Performing Services&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Internal Research for Tech Development&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Quality and Safety Maintenance and Verification&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;You may accept the sale to third parties of all or part of the non-sensitive information. To learn more about cookies, partners, and how we use your data, visit our &lt;a href=\"{privacyPolicyURL}\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</string>
